  "name": "crisisnet-dataset",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tCrisisNet \u2014 Corporate Default Risk Dataset\n\t\n\n\n\"Every cancer screening programme works on one insight: the disease speaks before the patient feels it. CrisisNet applies the same logic to corporate finance.\"\n\nCrisisNet is a multi-modal, network-aware dataset for building early-warning systems for corporate financial distress. It covers 40 U.S. Energy sector companies (S&P 500) over 10 years (2015\u20132025) across three parallel signal types: time series financials, NLP text from filings and\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Sashank-810/crisisnet-dataset.",
